       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CAISET4.
      * CASH ADVANCE INTEREST - STEP 1 RUN FLAG
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CAIFLG4.
       01  WS-CYCLE-DAY              PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
